(text "J1 and J2: pin 1 = L, pin 3 = N. Pin 2 is not connected: it drops into a\nnon-plated slot between L and N on the PCB.\nRT1 limits the inrush current of the 24 V supply input capacitors (81 uF):\n325 V / 10 ohm = 33 A peak. The supply has its own T2A fuse.\nH1 and H2: M3 holes between L and N, for nylon screws only." (at 25.4 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e195bee-6b01-5d44-a00c-f832371c9c93"))
